The recipe reuses an unchanged DejaVu Sans font, registry and full license from
examples/page-composition/raster-composition/fonts/. That font is covered by
its retained Bitstream Vera/DejaVu license, not this CC0 dedication. Repository
test implementation code retains the repository license. No private consumer
artwork, actual approval record or image/model service output is included.
